00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:18.819
administration is the realization that things
that are not normal are being normalized and

00:00:18.819 --> 00:00:20.089
hyper normalize.

00:00:20.089 --> 00:00:23.460
Now, some of this comes from numbness.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:28.839
Humans adapt and things become, quote, normal
very quickly.

00:00:28.839 --> 00:00:31.829
Even things we would not imagine would become
normal.

00:00:31.829 --> 00:00:38.019
Part of it is the Trump administration working
to normalize, for example, corruption, the

00:00:38.019 --> 00:00:43.059
