00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:51.840
Trump's violations regularly of the emoluments
clause, the weekly or sometimes almost daily

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:53.859
scandals with all of it.

00:00:53.859 --> 00:01:00.390
We have to work hard not to become numb and
desensitized to the insanity, but also the

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:03.550
Trump administration wants to make these things
normal.

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:08.369
And the truth is, it works in part because
humans adapt incredibly well and very quickly

00:01:08.369 --> 00:01:13.759
and outrageous situations become normal seeming
or normal feeling.

